ihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706692032","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:03:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4769670-1846018067927501","game_id":"steam-4769670","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update and Next Fest","summary":"Wow time flies.Greetings executives,Sometimes time slips by from you, and you don't end up providing the update cadence you thought you would. This is something I'm committed to working on through a Performance Improvement Plan. Anyway, on to specifics...Demo UpdateThe demo for Hostile Takeover, Inc. has been updated to include full generic controller support, as well as full control remapping! For those of you who shun the purity of keyboard+mouse, now is your time to rejoice!This also means th","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-07T20:30:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067927501","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:03:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4769670-1836506165563630","game_id":"steam-4769670","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update v0.7.1","summary":"Greetings, CEOs!I'm writing today to let you know of some updates I've made to the current demo build, bringing it to v0.7.1:Changelog:Enemy physics performance - Enemies now skip collision checks when in open space, reducing physics overhead by ~32%. From my benchmark testing, I saw the following improvements:Average FPS +4.3%1% Low FPS +10.9%Worst FPS +18.2%Boss pathfinding improvements - Tweaked the boss' pathfinding logic to reduce (and hopefully eliminate!) the likelihood of it getting stuc","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-30T21:21:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165563630","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:03:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4769670-1835871199308264","game_id":"steam-4769670","kind":"announcement","title":"Greetings and Welcome!","summary":"Greetings, CEOs!Welcome to the company. Whether you've already played the demo, provided feedback, or just wishlisted and walked away muttering about your own boss — thank you. Truly. A solo dev's most valuable asset is a few people who care, and you're it.For those just joining: Hostile Takeover, Inc. is a satirical top-down action tower defense where you don't just place towers — you play as the CEO, on the office floor. You hire employee towers, build departments, take promotions, and persona","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-19T21:59:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835871199308264","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:03:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4769670":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:07:46Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:07:45Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4769670":"2026-10-26T14:07:46Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4769670":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:07:45Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T14:07:45Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:07:45Z"},"4816330":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:07:46Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T14:07:46Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:07:46Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4769670","app_id":4769670,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:55Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"cb18c1f9ac22f7f987229b